Can someone TL;DR? What does this mean?<p>It just made me think, whether it&#x27;s related or not, shouldn&#x27;t the &quot;natural&quot; resting position of human heads be &quot;upwards&quot; like the rest of the animal world?<p>I mean if you consider the worm&#x2F;fish template, it&#x27;s<p><pre><code>    o---&gt;
</code></pre>
where &quot;o&quot; is the &quot;tail end&quot; and &quot;&gt;&quot; is the head. It points in the &quot;direction&quot; of the body. All other mammals and birds are also<p><pre><code>    o---&gt;
     | |
</code></pre>
